
### Missing name
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "09120000000"
}

### Missing number
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Salman"
}

### Duplicate name
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arto Hellas",
  "number": "09120000000"
}

### Empty name
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "number": "09120000000"
}


### Create a new person
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Salman1",
  "number": "09120000000"
}

### Get all persons
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons

### Get a person by ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons/6b0858b1e4b7aa29238227c1

### Get a person with invalid ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons/invalid-id

### Delete a person by ID
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/persons/6b0858b1e4b7aa29238227c1

### Delete a person by invalid ID
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/persons/invalid-id